      "description": "Note: You can easily convert this markdown file to a PDF in VSCode using this handy extension Markdown PDF.\nZorin OS is an Operating System based on the Ubuntu LTS that's designed to be easy, so you won't need to learn anything to get started. The Zorin Appearance app lets you change the desktop to resemble the environment you're familiar with, whether it's Windows, macOS, or Linux.\nZorin OS Ultimate is the best edition of Zorin OS with more apps and enhanced features. It also helps support Zorin OS's development.\nZorin OS Lite is an editon of Zorin for older computers that runs the lightweight desktop environment (XFCE) giving you a fast and snappy experience on a 10 year old computer.\nZorin Grid is a tool that makes it simple to set up, manage, and secure a fleet of Zorin OS-powered computers in your business, school, or organization.\nEtcher is an open source, cross-platform software that makes it easy to flash operating system images to a microSD card or USB device.\nRufus is a small application that creates bootable USB drives, which can then be used to install or run Microsoft Windows, Linux or DOS.",
